-The canonical cognitive-psychology taxonomy mapped to your agent's filesystem:
-
-| Layer | Type | What it holds | Path |
-|---|---|---|---|
-| 1 | **Episodic** | What happened in each session, chronologically. Auto-written during work. | `journal/` |
